# Contact sheets inspect every page layout/figure; selected dense formula text cross-read.
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES={}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_assignment1_basics.pdf']={'pages':47,'findings':[
(1,12,'2026版BPE：Unicode码点/UTF-8字节不同；special token隔离再预切分，不能跨边界合并。p7词频乘相邻pair出现次数，平局按字典序大者。encode重放merge rank，非最长字符串贪心；增量解码可能遇不完整UTF-8，uint16仅词表<65536适用。'),
(13,28,'两架构图为最终norm+LM head、串行pre-norm两残差。RMS公式这里含1/d，与讲义缺项勘误互证。SiLU平滑但有负值，SwiGLU三矩阵用8d/3与两矩阵4d近似等参。RoPE旋转Q/K非V、位置buffer非参数；mask=True表示可见，须核对API约定。2mnp为常用FLOPs近似，点积精确加法次数n−1。'),
(29,38,'stable cross entropy、perplexity=exp平均NLL。AdamW偏差修正与decoupled decay保留；图中把修正吸进LR时epsilon位置与标准写法数值可能不同，按版本测试。warmup/cosine边界、全梯度norm clipping、shifted targets、checkpoint optimizer状态、top-p累计重归一均需讲。'),
(39,47,'TinyStories LR/batch/norm位置/NoPE/SwiGLU消融保留，控制tokens、参数预算及重调LR，不能预写未跑的曲线。2026有CPU/MPS低资源提示，硬件时间不作本机承诺；库2.9.0限制标注历史版本。OWT迁移和榜单为可选知识背景。')], 'limits':'All 47 page layouts and figures inspected; dense formula sections cross-read as noted. Full graded implementation/training not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_assignment2_systems.pdf']={'pages':48,'findings':[
(1,10,'Nsight时间线区分host launch/device execution及warmup，CUDA计时需同步；mixed precision保留FP32累加与BF16存储区别。allocated/reserved峰值不同，profiler有开销。'),
(11,15,'saved_tensors hooks展示autograd残差与参数引用，不应简单重复相加推峰值；checkpoint以重算换内存，最优sqrt层数是简化模型。'),
(16,29,'block-pointer图横向advance是feature，纵向是row tile。online attention需同时更新m/l/未归一O，最后除l，并存L=m+logl；backward重算P并用D=rowSum(O*dO)。causal mask−1e6为题设近似，任意值范围下不等于数学−∞。算法双遍dQ/dK,dV避免跨block写冲突，不代表零重算。'),
(30,38,'rank图区分global/local/node，gloo/NCCL按设备；allreduce例全rank同得sum。flatten减少launch次数，异步handle必须wait且不能提前改buffer，communication overlap须看timeline。ZeRO1仅分optimizer state仍省显存。'),
(39,48,'FSDP/TP/2D公式按shape与group轴理解，reduce-scatter返回的shard为全rank求和，输入为partial full gradients；两轴通信可重叠取max是题设，争用时应加成本。critical batch非一过线必降低泛化。8B/32k双B200榜单与旧版attention单kernel目标不同，不能移植测速数字。')], 'limits':'All 48 page layouts/figures inspected and online attention/parallel formula sections cross-read; NVIDIA/Nsight/Triton/multi-GPU execution not reproduced.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_assignment3_scaling.pdf']={'pages':8,'findings':[(1,3,'2026加入真实wall-clock预算与可变架构/优化器；合成IsoFLOPs先取每预算最低已测loss而非保证连续最优，C≈6ND不能忽略长上下文等项。'),(4,8,'模型参数、tokens、运行时三预算不同。API校内凭证/12 B200小时拟合与48小时外推仅原作业，不尝试取得凭证。实验记录须含失败/中止，不把最终loss等同完整收敛；不能用12L d²估计任意MoE/不同FFN。')], 'limits':'All 8 page layouts/formulas inspected and scaling text read; original restricted API unavailable and not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_assignment4_data.pdf']={'pages':16,'findings':[(1,9,'WARC原HTML/WET已有抽取/WAT元数据区分；非正文抽取会影响质量。fastText langID、规则PII、toxicity/NSFW各有误杀漏检，概率并非校准保证。Wiki正样本/CC负样本训练的是分布代理，不是真理质量标签。'),(10,12,'exact-line题设删除所有出现>1的行，不能写成只保留首份。MinHash先候选再真Jaccard，band索引必须入bucket key；连接分量A-B/B-C不保证A-C相似。LSH增加bands在固定hash数时提升召回但可能降低候选精度。'),(13,16,'固定GPT2模型/训练仅变数据才公平。可参看Paloma validation做筛选设计，禁止复制进训练，反复调参仍需独立最终test。网页抽样检查、保留比例/域变化和失败记录保留。')], 'limits':'All 16 layouts and examples inspected, dedup text cross-read; no complete Common Crawl pipeline/model training rerun.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2026_assignment5_alignment.pdf']={'pages':39,'findings':[(1,7,'2026使用OLMo-2-0425-1B/GSM8K，与2025Qwen/MATH不同；zero/few-shot/CoT提示和答案parser需独立检查格式/正确奖励。'),(8,13,'score-function与action-independent baseline不偏前提。group mean包含自身时梯度期望乘(G−1)/G，组std再改变目标权重；torch.std默认sample与公式population需区分。sequence length平均改变token权重。'),(14,25,'response_mask避免训练prompt/pad，old policy和vLLM权重同步，梯度累积按全局正常化而非简单每microbatch均值。图表作业要求尚无实验数据，不造30%奖励曲线。'),(26,31,'DrGRPO去std与长度但仍有有限G均值偏差；RFT只正确样本与baseline策略不同。MaxRL本作业用constant Z，原论文按batch token数，不能称完全相同。极限G→∞二元奖励权重：Dr1，std1/sqrt(p(1−p))，mean1/p；p=0/1须epsilon/零优势处理，有限G不直接等于极限。'),(32,39,'完整sequence重要性比需support，产品可能高方差但非每样本必指数爆炸；token ratio仅校正一步，其余前后缀仍旧策略。clipping的min依优势正负作用不同，不保证KL约束；GSPO取几何均值引入偏差并自然带1/L，CISPO梯度截断与PPO平坦区不同。')], 'limits':'All 39 layouts/formula pages inspected and derivation text cross-read; no full RL/GPU run performed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2026_assignment5_supplement_safety_rlhf.pdf']={'pages':18,'findings':[(1,8,'保留MMLU/GSM8K/AlpacaEval/SimpleSafetyTests四类目标、parser失败率/throughput、自动judge误判与过拒。Llama3.1-8B基座与Llama3.3-70B参考不可混同。'),(9,14,'SFT prompt-output拼接、label shift和response-only loss；有效batch与microbatch区分。沿用统一prompt/decoding才比较SFT前后；red-team例不代表全面安全。'),(15,18,'DPO无显式RM但有隐式偏好模型，固定SFT reference，不与old rollout混用。chosen/rejected需同prompt且标注分布有偏；sum logp与长度bias、loss稳定logsigmoid要解释。')], 'limits':'All 18 layouts/examples/formulas inspected; GPU SFT/DPO and judge API not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment1_basics.pdf']={'pages':50,'findings':[(1,13,'BPE字节合并流程、预切分边界、special token、encode merge rank与吞吐/压缩率实验均保留；2025版低资源提示不等于2026实测硬件时间。'),(14,28,'架构/残差/SiLU图与2026同概念但页码不同；2025 d_ff建议64倍数、算量题GPT2-shaped非原GPT2架构。RMS此版有1/d，可作为讲义勘误互证。'),(29,39,'stable CE/SGD/AdamW/cosine/gradient clipping、memmap+shift target/checkpoint、temperature/top-p均覆盖；全FP32内存账本不能直接当BF16峰值。'),(40,50,'TinyStories与OWT、norm消融/NoPE/SwiGLU对SiLU保留。H100小时限制和排行榜为历史版本，曲线/分数属于待运行要求非原答案。')], 'limits':'All 50 layouts/main figures inspected; no full graded training rerun.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment2_systems.pdf']={'pages':37,'findings':[(1,9,'2025 profiler/FP32-BF16/显存截图例题与2026新增checkpoint章节区分；Nsight统计不等于PyTorch单op名字，异步必须同步后计时。'),(10,24,'weighted-sum tile图和FlashAttention算法逐图核对，m/l/O在线更新、L保存反向重算P。旧版benchmark至16384/new版可65536不同，不借用速度结果。'),(25,34,'global/local/node rank图、naive/flatten/异步/bucket DDP到optimizer sharding，等待和bucket-size取舍需保留。ZeRO1分optimizer后更新权重需要一致同步。'),(35,37,'DP/ZeRO1/gradaccum算量比较保留；2025榜单只attention kernel，与2026全8B训练步不同。')], 'limits':'All 37 page layouts/main figures inspected; GPU/Nsight/multi-GPU workloads not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment3_scaling.pdf']={'pages':6,'findings':[(1,3,'固定FLOPs外推，合成IsoFLOPs可拟二次曲线求低点但作业建议选已测最低；离散最优有网格误差。'),(4,6,'当年API按FLOPs硬预算限制并非2026wall-clock接口；固定12 heads等约束和实际data/architecture recipe会限制拟合，不称已运行服务。')], 'limits':'All 6 layouts/formulas inspected; historical restricted API not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment4_data.pdf']={'pages':17,'findings':[(1,8,'WARC/WET解析、语言/PII/有害规则与质量分类代理保留，2025提供slurm并行示例不等于在线自学必须有集群。'),(9,11,'exact-line删除重复全部出现，MinHash+LSH候选后Jaccard确认；connected component去重链条不等于每对过阈值。'),(12,17,'并行过滤/保留域分布/人工抽样/uint16 token化/fixed-model比较保留。Paloma作筛选验证不得复制入训练；机械成功不等于质量提高。')], 'limits':'All 17 layouts/examples inspected; full crawl/model runs not rerun.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment5_alignment.pdf']={'pages':38,'findings':[(1,6,'Qwen2.5-Math-1.5B/MATH基线与2026 OLMo/GSM8K区分；p3注明MATH原始数据取得限制并列替代数据。不能把拿不到原数据当作已复现实验。'),(7,15,'SFT response mask与label shift、per-token entropy、microbatch/global normalizer；expert iteration对自身正确生成再SFT，与强模型蒸馏不同。'),(16,24,'policy梯度/旧策略IS/GRPO clipped ratio正负优势分开；logp*adv是产生梯度的surrogate非可跨运行比较的reward指标。去std不自动去长度归一化/有限G bias。'),(25,33,'masked_mean与constant normalizer改变长度权重，p30–31数值例用于比较；离策略增加minibatches保持old_logp冻结，prompt ablation/seed方差/格式奖励均保留。'),(34,38,'未用KL是本作业简化，不代表KL在所有算法无用。系统优化参考vLLM/verl等仍需版本与正确性验证，排行榜为历史要求。')], 'limits':'All 38 layouts/formula/algorithm pages inspected; selected helper math cross-read. No full RL/GPU or restricted data experiment reproduced.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2025_assignment5_supplement_safety_rlhf.pdf']={'pages':19,'findings':[(1,8,'四评测MMLU/GSM8K/AlpacaEval/SimpleSafetyTests与基座/参考模型区分，parser失败单独报，GPT judge非完美真值。'),(9,15,'SFT拼接和mask/grad accumulation、同prompt前后对比、red teaming与过拒保留；文中H100小时为原配方。'),(16,19,'HH chosen/rejected、固定reference及DPO logsigmoid之差，保留长度偏差/分布支持前提，不用训练loss降代替用户偏好/安全收益。')], 'limits':'All 19 layouts/examples/formulas inspected; SFT/DPO GPU training/judge API not executed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2024_assignment1_basics.pdf']={'pages':34,'findings':[(1,10,'BPE字节/UTF8和低频词、预切分/合并顺序等保留；旧版special-token/词频toy例不当当前GPT4 tokenizer实现。'),(11,18,'2024架构图含learned absolute position相加、GELU两矩阵、dropout，不能用2025RoPE/SwiGLU覆盖。串行两残差及最终RMSNorm保留。RMS这里已有1/d，讲义缺项可互证。'),(19,27,'stable CE、SGD、AdamW、cosine、clip、data shift/checkpoint/temperature/top-p与新版同原理；本版dropout训练/eval行为也须讲。'),(28,34,'旧版有parallel FFN+attention消融以及dropout超参，不应丢掉；TinyStories/OWT与训练曲线要求尚无给定结果，不编实验结论。')], 'limits':'All 34 layouts/main figures/formulas inspected; original training not rerun.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2024_assignment2_systems.pdf']={'pages':30,'findings':[(1,8,'2024系统作业是RMSNorm kernel而非后来的FlashAttention。PyTorch profiler/flamegraph含调用层级和self/total，不能把CPU时间当GPU总时长。'),(9,17,'weighted-sum逐程序一row与反向partial weight reduce、RMSNorm forward/backward公式、torch.compile对比与显存profile保留。RMSNorm rows独立但gain梯度跨rows归约，避免race。'),(18,23,'local/global/node rank图和Slurm多node启动例保留，和单机mp.spawn不同；gloo/NCCL需设备/环境匹配。'),(24,30,'flatten/async/bucket DDP到ZeRO1 optimizer sharding，hook触发与wait界限、bucket tradeoff需解释；未声称已复现多机数据。')], 'limits':'All 30 layouts/main figures/formulas inspected; no NVIDIA/Triton/multi-node benchmark execution.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2024_assignment3_scaling.pdf']={'pages':6,'findings':[(1,3,'历史FLOPs预算/合成IsoFLOPs最低点拟合保留；离散网格及外推的不确定性不可省略。'),(4,6,'原API固定12heads、训练数据等约束，learned absolute positions与GELU，不直接当2025/26接口。API额度/可用性未验证，无凭证不运行。')], 'limits':'All 6 layouts/formulas inspected; restricted API not accessed.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2024_assignment4_data.pdf']={'pages':16,'findings':[(1,8,'原HTML抽取使用resiliparse，语言/PII/有害/质量过滤各看偏差。WARC/WET/WAT角色不同，不把课程示例网页当全部真实分布。'),(9,11,'exact-line题设删除所有重复行；LSH候选后真Jaccard确认，链式cluster不要求每对相似。'),(12,16,'旧版直接用WARC转正文再过滤，后版提供English WET起点；保留固定GPT2模型评估、域分布/保留率和人工抽样，Paloma validation不复制训练。')], 'limits':'All 16 layouts/examples inspected; full crawl/model experiments not rerun.'}
ASSIGNMENT_FIGURE_NOTES['cs336_spring2024_assignment5_alignment.pdf']={'pages':21,'findings':[(1,9,'Llama3-8B基座/70B参考的MMLU/GSM8K/AlpacaEval/SimpleSafetyTests基线，不同于后版3.1/3.3型号；parser错误与judge误判单列。'),(10,16,'SFT response-only loss、padding/shift和gradient accumulation，固定解码设定做前后对比，red teaming与过拒均需讲。'),(17,21,'DPO固定SFT reference、同prompt偏好对与数值稳定logsigmoid；HH的helpfulness/harmlessness偏好群体不同，不把训练loss当安全保证。')], 'limits':'All 21 layouts/formulas inspected; no full SFT/DPO/GPU/judge runs reproduced.'}
